    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INTRODUCTION</h2>LIFESPAWN is a 2D platformer with a difference: you place your own checkpoints... good luck.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2>Jump your way from grassy fields to rustic killhouses, climb to the heights of a skyscraper and dive deep into the depths of hidden sewers in one long, long level. However, there are no checkpoints. Instead, you have 3 placeable hearts that you'll respawn at when you die. 3 hearts, one level and a world of heartbreak and rage may be your future depending on your heart placement.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2>Although there is no direct story, you may find signs of something being ever so slightly wrong with the world of LIFESPAWN...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><i>A Sprawling World</i><br><i>Unique Heart Gameplay</i>",
